  "notes": "ねじ refers to screws and winding mechanisms. Can also be written as {螺子|ねじ} or ネジ.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ねじを{締|し}める: to tighten a screw\n- ねじを{緩|ゆる}める: to loosen a screw\n- ねじを{巻|ま}く: to wind (a clock)\n- ねじ{回|まわ}し: screwdriver\n\nIDIOMS:\n- ねじが{外|はず}れている: to have a screw loose (be crazy)\n- ねじを{巻|ま}く: to put pressure on, to discipline\n\nRELATED:\n- ボルト: bolt\n- ナット: nut (for bolts)",
